%N A402142 Regular triangle read by rows where T(n,k) is the number of k-part integer compositions of n that do not comprise a 1-based restricted growth sequence.
%C A402142 A 1-based restricted growth sequence of length j is a sequence (a_1, ..., a_j), satisfying a_1 = 1 and a_i <= 1 + max(a_1, ..., a_{i-1}) for all i = 2, 3, ..., j.
